    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Call for tenders – City of Belval Implementation of an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to the agents City of Belval 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to take into account the context of the file when this one is available. 3.4 Collaboration and continuity of processing The expected solution will have to facilitate the continuity of the processing of the files between agents and services, by allowing: a sharing of relevant information, an understanding of the context of an ongoing file, an effective resumption of the processing by another agent. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As for cost-optimization strategies, our company context mentions that in the event of a budget reduction of 10 percent, our can absorb a budget reduction of 10 percent via rate renegotiation with subcontractors." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This suggests some flexibility in our cost structure that could be leveraged to optimize costs and potentially offer competitive pricing while maintaining an acceptable margin." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, considering our standard daily rates for various roles, our might propose a tailored team composition that balances expertise with cost-effectiveness to deliver the required functionalities within the budget constraints." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, without more detailed project requirements and specifics on the tasks involved, it's challenging to provide a precise optimization strategy. our current financial position, with an equity of 1,450,000 euros and a debt-to-equity ratio of 0.42, indicates our have a stable financial foundation to undertake new projects. our credit line of 300,000 euros available also provides a buffer for managing cash flow during the project execution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Thus, while our can propose competitive pricing and have some flexibility in our cost structure, the exact margin and detailed cost-optimization strategies would depend on a more detailed breakdown of project costs and requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client expects a solution that assists users (req42) with a high level of relevance of the answers (req46), and provides times of response compatible with daily use (con24)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can our AI components and innovation strategy meet expects, including the provision of contextualized answers (req26) and help with drafting administrative contents (req27)?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address The client expectations for a solution that assists users with highly relevant answers and provides timely responses, our can leverage our expertise in AI research and development, particularly in large language models. our preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, has demonstrated strong performance in French-language tasks, which is crucial given the context of the City of Belval. our can fine-tune Our preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct using our established methods such as LoRA or QLoRA to adapt Our preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct to the specific administrative domain and ensure a high level of relevance in Our preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct answers. our experience with full fine-tuning on domain-specific corpora can further enhance Our preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct accuracy and contextual understanding, meeting requirement 26 for contextualized answers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To assist with drafting administrative contents as per requirement 27, our can utilize the capabilities of our language models to generate coherent and relevant text based on the context provided. utilize can be particularly useful for tasks such as answering user queries, drafting administrative letters, or synthesizing files. our Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) capabilities can play a significant role in enhancing the relevance and accuracy of the answers by providing access to a knowledge base of internal procedures, regulatory texts, and other relevant documents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This aligns with requirement 42 for assisting users with information retrieval and drafting tasks." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regulatory and legal constraints The expected solution will have to imperatively respect the regulatory requirements in force. 4.1 Protection of data The holder will have to guarantee a strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure timely responses as indicated in constraint 24, our can optimize our solution's performance through quantization methods like INT8 or INT4 (GPTQ), which have been shown to significantly reduce the computational requirements without compromising on the accuracy. optimize will enable our solution's to provide answers within the expected response time of less than 2 seconds, making our solution's suitable for daily use by municipal agents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, our commitment to explainability and transparency, as evidenced by our use of methods like source citation (RAG grounding), chain-of-thought display, SHAP for classification models, and LIME, will ensure that the recommendations or proposals issued by our solution's can be understood and trusted, thereby meeting The client expectations for explicability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By integrating these components and strategies, our believe our solution's can effectively meet The client requirements for relevance, response time, and contextualized assistance, while also ensuring compliance with regulatory constraints and contributing to a reduction in environmental footprint through optimized energy consumption." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client grants a particular importance to sovereignty of the data (con33), environmental footprint (con39), and reduction of energetic consumption (con40)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can our CSR and sustainability posture contribute to sovereignty of the data (con33), environmental footprint (con39), and reduction of energetic consumption (con40), including relying on infrastructures with low carbon impact (con41) and proposing a solution that contributes to the reduction of the energetic consumption?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., has a strong CSR and sustainability posture that aligns with the client's requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can contribute to the client's goals by leveraging Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. environmental capabilities, such as Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. green hosting partners OVHcloud and Scaleway, both located in France, which use 100% renewable energy and have low power usage effectiveness (PUE) ratings of 1.3 and 1.28 respectively." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, both partners are ISO14001 certified, ensuring both partners commitment to environmental management." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. digital sobriety practices can also help reduce energetic consumption." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For example, Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. use INT8/INT4 model quantisation, which reduces GPU energy by approximately 40%, and auto-scaling to zero outside business hours." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To this title: the data will have to be hosted exclusively on the territory of the European Union, no transfer of data outside the European Union will be authorized, the data will have to be protected in an appropriate manner (encryption, anonymization if necessary). 4.2 Explicability and transparency the local authority expects that the recommendations or proposals issued by The expected solution can be explained." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. also implement query result caching, which is estimated to reduce recomputes by 20%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. green IT hardware procurement policy ensures a minimum 5-year lifecycle for Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. equipment." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of carbon reporting, Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. have the capability to report on Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. carbon footprint using the GRI Standards (partial), and Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. typically achieve energy reductions of around 35% compared to baseline." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By hosting the solution with Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. green hosting partners and implementing Our digital sobriety practices, Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can contribute to reducing the environmental footprint and energetic consumption of the client's systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding data sovereignty, Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can ensure that all data is hosted exclusively within the European Union, as required by the client, and that no data transfers outside the European Union are authorized." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can also guarantee the protection of sensitive data through encryption and anonymization if necessary." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, our CSR and sustainability posture can help the client achieve the client goals of reducing energetic consumption, relying on low-carbon infrastructures, and ensuring data sovereignty, while also contributing to a more environmentally friendly solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering proposes a comprehensive solution to address the City of Belval's requirements for an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance tool." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering consortium will design, implement, and deploy a tailored AI solution to improve the efficiency of administrative services and enhance the quality of service rendered to users. a comprehensive solution to address the City of Belval's requirements for an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance tool will provide intelligent assistance to agents in agents daily missions, facilitating access to reliable and up-to-date information, and enabling agents to process an increased volume of requests efficiently. a comprehensive solution to address the City of Belval's requirements for an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance tool will be designed as a decision support system, ensuring that decisions are automated only with explicit validation from an agent. a comprehensive solution to address the City of Belval's requirements for an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance tool will also guarantee a high level of availability, with an expected response time of less than 2 seconds, and an availability of 99.9%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure seamless integration, a comprehensive solution to address the City of Belval's requirements for an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance tool will be compatible with existing systems of information, business software, electronic management of documents, and user directories." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It will have to be possible, a posteriori, to understand the elements having led to an answer or a suggestion. 4.3 Responsibility The expected solution will have to be designed as a tool of assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering will provide APIs to facilitate integration and ensure data sovereignty by hosting a comprehensive solution to address the City of Belval's requirements for an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance tool exclusively on European Union territory, with no data transfers authorized outside European Union." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our consortium is committed to environmental sustainability, and a comprehensive solution to address the City of Belval's requirements for an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance tool will contribute to reducing energetic consumption and relying on low-carbon impact infrastructures." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering will implement digital sobriety practices, including model quantization, auto-scaling, and query result caching, to minimize the environmental footprint of a comprehensive solution to address the City of Belval's requirements for an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance tool." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The project deployment will be conducted in a progressive manner, with a pilot phase on a limited scope, followed by a gradual generalization to the entirety of the services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering will provide accompaniment to change and training for agents to ensure a smooth transition." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering pricing model is competitive, with a target gross margin percentage of 28% and a projected revenue of €3 million over a duration of 4 years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering are committed to optimizing costs while ensuring the quality of service, and Nexus Engineering propose an approach to optimize costs through rate renegotiation with subcontractors and cost structure flexibility." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering has a strong CSR posture, with a focus on environmental sustainability, data sovereignty, and social responsibility. a comprehensive solution to address the City of Belval's requirements for an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance tool will be designed to respect regulatory requirements, including GDPR, and ensure the protection of personal data using encryption and anonymization if necessary." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk138> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In conclusion, a comprehensive solution to address the City of Belval's requirements for an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance tool addresses all the requirements and constraints outlined in the call for tenders." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk139> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering are confident that a comprehensive solution to address the City of Belval's requirements for an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance tool will improve the efficiency and quality of administrative services, while minimizing environmental impact and ensuring regulatory compliance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk14> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No decision will be able to be automated without explicit validation of an agent. 5." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk140> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our consortium is well-equipped to deliver a high-quality solution, and Nexus Engineering look forward to the opportunity to collaborate with the City of Belval on this project." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk15> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Technical constraints 5.1 Performance The expected solution will have to provide times of response compatible with a daily use by the agents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk16> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To indicative title, a time of response lower than 2 seconds is expected for the current requests." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk17> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "A high level of relevance of the answers is expected. 5.2 Availability The expected solution will have to guarantee a high level of availability, compatible with the needs of the municipal services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk18> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "An objective of availability of the order of 99.9% is expected. 5.3 Integration The expected solution will have to integrate The expected solution with the existing system of information, notably: the business softwares (civil status, town planning), the electronic management of documents (EDM), the user directories." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk19> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Interfaces of API type will be expected. 6." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk2> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Context and objectives of the project In the framework of City of Belval digital transformation strategy, City of Belval wishes to improve the efficiency of City of Belval administrative services and the quality of service rendered to the users. the agents are today confronted with a growing complexity of the procedures, with a multiplicity of the sources of information (regulations, internal procedures, business systems) and with an increase of the volume of requests to process." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk20> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Sovereignty constraints the local authority grants a particular importance to the sovereignty of the data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

