    <http://example.org/node/chunk59> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the requirements for the city of Belval to implement an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to the agents (req1), improve efficiency of administrative services (req2), and improve quality of service rendered to users (req3), how can we consolidate all agent contributions into a coherent tender response, ensuring decision traceability and detecting contradictions?" ;
