    <http://example.org/node/chunk67> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on The client requirements, our propose an architecture that leverages our expertise in API integration, cloud architecture, and data engineering. our will design a solution that integrates with the existing system of information, business softwares, electronic management of documents, and user directories using APIs." ;
