    <http://example.org/node/chunk68> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To achieve integrates, our will utilize our experience with API gateways such as Kong and Apigee, which will enable our to create interfaces of API type as required by con32. our will also employ our knowledge of message brokers like Apache Kafka and RabbitMQ to facilitate communication between the various systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk69> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For high availability, our will deploy The solution on a cloud infrastructure that provides redundancy and failover capabilities." ;
