        ex:hasText "Functional scope The expected solution will have to cover the following functionalities: 3.1 Assistance with the consultation of information The expected solution will have to allow the agents to access quickly to reliable and up-to-date information coming from: the internal procedures, the applicable regulatory texts, the internal documents (guides, notes, repositories)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk70> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our experience with cloud providers such as OVHcloud, Scaleway, and Outscale (SecNumCloud), our can ensure that The solution is deployed in a secure and reliable environment. our expertise in containerization using Docker and Kubernetes (K8s) will also enable our to design a highly available and scalable architecture." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk71> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To guarantee an availability of 99.9%, our will implement monitoring tools such as Prometheus, Grafana, and ELK stack to ensure that The solution is running smoothly and that any issues are quickly identified and addressed. our experience with infrastructure as code (IaC) tools like Terraform and Ansible will enable our to automate the deployment and management of the infrastructure, further ensuring high availability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk72> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of specific technical components, our propose using a combination of our AI/ML stack, including LLM models such as Mistral 7B or LLaMA 3, and RAG frameworks like LangChain or LlamaIndex. our will also utilize vector databases like Qdrant or Weaviate to store and manage the data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk73> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For inference servers, our can use vLLM or Ollama, which will enable our to provide fast and accurate responses to the agents' queries." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk74> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, our proposed architecture is designed to meet the client's technical constraints while providing a highly available, scalable, and secure solution that leverages our expertise in API integration, cloud architecture, and data engineering." ;
